(text "Layer 1, no software: key and E-stop in series with the K1 coil; either one opens K1 whatever the ESP32 does." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bf4359dd-a5c5-5707-90e8-74305f0eaf9a"))
(text "Q1 lets the ESP32 open K1 but never close it. Reset, crash or brown-out opens it (R2 pull-down)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 17.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff9e597c-77fb-5a9d-bc5a-c6fb3f38826b"))
(text "Rails come from the key side, before K1, so the ESP32 stays up after an E-stop and can report why." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 20.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (italic yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8782e5d0-e57e-5b62-9cea-ef96a6dda6d7"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
